	-- {quest:84197} Saving the Best for Last · {item:16686} Magister's Crown · {npc:1853} Darkmaster Gandling · {area:2057} Scholomance · {item:16688} Magister's Robes · {npc:10363} General Drakkisath
	["{quest:84197} takes your {item:16686}: {npc:1853} in {area:2057} (about 13%), and your {item:16688}: {npc:10363} in Upper Blackrock Spire (about 11%)."] = "{quest:84197} pide tu {item:16686}: {npc:1853} en {area:2057} (alrededor del 13 %), y tu {item:16688}: {npc:10363} en la Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior (alrededor del 11 %).",

	-- Step 59: Mokvar: Saving the Best for Last
	-- {quest:84205} Saving the Best for Last · {item:16686} Magister's Crown · {npc:1853} Darkmaster Gandling · {area:2057} Scholomance · {item:16688} Magister's Robes · {npc:10363} General Drakkisath
	["{quest:84205} takes your {item:16686}: {npc:1853} in {area:2057} (about 13%), and your {item:16688}: {npc:10363} in Upper Blackrock Spire (about 11%)."] = "{quest:84205} pide tu {item:16686}: {npc:1853} en {area:2057} (alrededor del 13 %), y tu {item:16688}: {npc:10363} en la Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior (alrededor del 11 %).",

